    reused detail multipliers and separate residual-support/attenuation marches. Exact arbitrary-
    column optical depth remains an independent reference, not a hidden production integration pass.
    Native finite bounds and existing OIT outputs remain explicit adaptations with quality checks.
  Revised arithmetic receipts are artifacts/CloudRealtime/policy-revision/check-policy-math.ps1 and
    policy-math-results.json, separate from the frozen baseline evidence. Checks passed for eleven
    primary examples, ninety supported-control combinations, uniform spacing/weights, ten quadratic
    shadow intervals, five finite-exit examples, six legacy mappings and three nonfinite fallbacks.
    The ten shadow weights sum to 1500 world units; arithmetic midpoint positions are 7.5..1357.5.
